  infrastructure. The supercomputer FinisTerrae III and its permanent
  data storage system have been funded by the NextGeneration EU 2021
  Recovery, Transformation and Resilience Plan, ICT2021-006904, and also
  from the Pluriregional Operational Programme of Spain 2014-2020 of the
  European Regional Development Fund (ERDF), ICTS-2019-02-CESGA-3, and
  from the State Programme for the Promotion of Scientific and Technical
  Research of Excellence of the State Plan for Scientific and Technical
  Research and Innovation 2013-2016 State subprogramme for scientific
  and technical infrastructures and equipment of ERDF,
  CESG15-DE-3114.</p>
</sec>
